          feedback: { correct: 'Correct — the second term is the load reflected back through the network.', wrong: ['Correct - the second term is the load reflected back through the network.', 'Wrong - z11 is the open-circuit value only and ignores the load entirely.', 'Wrong - the load does not simply add in series; it is reflected through the transfer terms.', 'Wrong - this expression has no physical basis and is dimensionally wrong.'] },
